<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">Do AI engines store user data from AEO-optimized content?</h3>
<p class="text-white/70">AI engines typically process and may store user interaction data when users engage with AEO-optimized content. The specific data retention practices vary by platform and user settings.</p>
</div>
<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">What consent is required for behavioral analytics in AEO platforms?</h3>
